msgid "⟪k:0⟫Eventually..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Со временем..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_080797CE_CCAE_4D3F_986F_ADF0C94FC215
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
